--- ── user_state: one row per user, all synced store snapshots as JSON ────────
--- `stores` shape:  { "jmind:tasks": { "data": {...}, "updatedAt": "ISO" }, ... }
--- The per-store `updatedAt` drives last-writer-wins conflict handling.
